menu "Application"

config APP_BUSY_LOOP
	bool "Wait for the timer in a busy loop"
	help
	  Makes main() wait for the timer by spinning on a flag, instead of blocking on a semaphore.
	  On a microcontroller that works, wastefully. On native_sim it never finishes, because
	  no simulated time passes while a thread runs, so the timer never expires.

endmenu

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
